							<h1 style="FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: georgia" align="center"><font color="#0000ff"><img src="/pics/1602/heros.jpg" /></font></h1> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rock.JPG" /></p> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#0000ff" size="3"><strong></strong></font></p> <p align="center"><font size="4">Uanelil</font></p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rotstar2_e0.gif" /></p> <p align="center">One of those rare people who just rock in general, Uanelil has always been there for the guild.&nbsp; Never complaining, but always helpful, Uanelil takes the first ever award of Moonlite Redemption.&nbsp; Three cheers for our Most Valuable Member of August, 2004!&nbsp;</p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rock.JPG" /></p> <p></p> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#0000ff"><strong></strong></font></p> <p align="center"><font size="4">Rufusius</font></p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/star_e0.gif" /></p> <p align="center">Rufusius has never been late to a raid!&nbsp; He puts the guild before himself and has even been known to wake up in the middle of the night just to help us out in a raid.&nbsp; What a guy!&nbsp; I can't think of anyone more suited to this award, Congratulations Rufusius, on your Mark of Punctuality award.&nbsp; You rock! </p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rock.JPG" /></p> <p align="center"><strong><font face="Georgia" color="#0000ff"></font></strong></p> <p align="center"><font size="4">Scuby</font></p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/Awards/award3.bmp" /></p> <p align="center">Scuby is easily one of the most patient among us.&nbsp; I've never heard him complain about anything.&nbsp; His ability to put up with all that we throw at him is astounding!&nbsp; He's an all around good sport.&nbsp;&nbsp; The Plaque of Patience is the least we can do for this rogue.&nbsp; Scuby Due, We love you!</p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rock.JPG" /></p>
							
